सम्-आ-√ स्था P. Ā. -तिष्ठति, ˚ते, to mount, ascend, Hariv.;
to go to, R.;
to stop, halt, MBh.;
to enter upon, undergo, undertake (a march), assume (a form), seek (a maintenance), apply (assiduity) to (loc.), MBh.; R. &c. ;
to perform, accomplish, BhP. :
Caus. -स्थापयति, to cause to stop, make to halt, R.;
to cause to be performed or practised, ib.

सम्-√ अस् P. -अस्ति, to be like, equal (acc.), RV.;
to be united with (सह), AV.;
to be (there), exist, Kāv.

सम्-√ अस् P. -अस्यति (Ved. inf. सम्-आ॑सम्), to throw or put together, add, combine, compound, mix, mingle, connect, AV.; ŚBr.; KātyŚr.; Śulbas. :
Pass. -अस्यते, to be put together or combined &c.;
 (in gram.) to be compounded, form a compound, Pāṇ. ii, 2, 1 &c.

सम्-√ अश् P. Ā. -अश्नोति, -अश्नुते (in ŚBr. once fut. अश्नुविष्यामहे), to reach, attain, gain, obtain, RV. &c. &c.;
to accomplish, fulfil (a wish), RV.;
to pervade or penetrate thoroughly (see सम्-अष्टि).

सम्-√ आस् Ā. -आस्ते (pr. p. -आसीन, q.v.), to sit together, sit or assemble round (acc.), RV.; AV.; MBh.;
to sit, be seated, Mn.; R.;
to sit or abide in (loc.), R. ;
to hold a council, deliberate, AV.; ŚBr.;
to practise, observe (acc.), R.;
to behave like (इव), resemble, MBh.;
to be dejected or low-spirited, R.;
to mind, attend to, acknowledge, R.;
to be a match for, cope with (acc.), MBh.; R.

सम्-आ-√ शंस् P. Ā. -शंसति, ˚ते, (P.) to adjudge, assign anything to (dat.), RV.;
 (Ā.) to trust or confide in (acc.), MBh.;
to wish or long for, desire, MW.

सम्-आ-√ श्रि P. Ā. -श्रयति, ˚ते, to go or have recourse to together (esp. for protection), fly to for refuge, seek refuge with, lean on, trust to, confide in (acc.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to resort to, approach, enter, occupy, obtain, assume, ib.;
to follow, practise, MBh.; Kāv. &c.

सम्-आ-√ श्लिष् P. -श्लिष्यति, to cling to (acc.), MBh.;
to embrace closely or firmly, ib. &c.:
Caus. -श्लेषयति, to join together, TS.

सम्-आ-√ श्वस् P. -श्वसिति, or -श्वसति, to breathe again, recover breath, revive, take courage (often in 2. sg. Impv. -श्वसिहि, ‘take courage!’), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to trust or confide in (loc.), MBh. :
Caus. -श्वासयति, to cause to revive, reanimate, encourage, comfort, calm, console, MBh.; R. &c.

सम्-आ-√ सञ्ज् P. -सजति, to fasten or stick together, join or attach to, fix or place on, wrap or suspend round, MBh.; Hariv.;
to impose, resign or deliver over to (loc.), Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Pass. -सज्यते, or -सज्जते, to cling or adhere closely together, cling or stick to, become attached to, MW.

सम्-आ-√ सद् P. -सीदति, to be take one's self to, come near to, approach or advance to, reach, arrive at (acc.), MBh.; R. &c.;
to meet, encounter (either in a friendly or hostile manner), attack, assail, MBh.;
to attain, obtain, meet with, find, recover, Rājat.; Kathās. :
Caus. -सादयति (ind.p. -साद्य, q.v.), to come to, to approach, advance to, arrive at, fall or get into, reach, attain, incur, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 meet, encounter (a friend or enemy), attack, assail, ib.;
to hit (as an arrow), MBh.;
to accrue to (acc.), Rājat.
